[2026-09-26T17:59:55.924+08:00] [TestGenerator][REQ-1-1-1] 6. Prefer one stable file per layer unless scenarios naturally split into coherent groups.
[2026-09-26T17:59:55.924+08:00] [TestGenerator][REQ-1-1-1] 7. Do not create tests for parent-owned shell behavior or child-owned future behavior.
